    "preamble": "V.Mohan vs State Represented By Its on 10 December, 2024 Author: N.Anand Venkatesh Bench: N.Anand Venkatesh Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated : 10.12.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice N.Anand Venkatesh Crl.O.P(MD)No.21875 of 2022 and Crl.M.P(MD)Nos.15419 and 15420 of 2022 1. V.Mohan 2. M/s.Pure and Cure Aquaa Foods, Represented by its representative (V.Mohan) No.138, Sanjeevi Nagar, Chennai Bye Pass Road, Trichy. ... Petiti Vs State represented by its The Food Safety Officer, Trichy Corporation, Code No.592, Tamilnadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Deputy Director Health Service Complex, Trichy District-2. ... Respond Prayer: Criminal Original petitions have been filed under Sections (1) (b) of the Code of Criminal Procedure, to call for the entire r relating to the proceeding in C.C.No.138 of 2022 on the file of lea Judicial Magistrate No.I, Trichy and quash the same as illegal. https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis",
